## Why This Is Asked
This probes cross-region real-time reliability, backpressure handling, and semantics trade-offs in a live data plane.

## Key Concepts
- Tail latency monitoring; regional failover
- Backpressure and traffic shaping
- Exactly-once vs at-least-once semantics
- Offset management and idempotent processing
- Chaos testing and post-incident reviews

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo idempotent replay handler
function processEvent(evt){
  const id = evt.id;
  if (processedSet.has(id)) return;
  store.update(evt.payload);
  processedSet.add(id);
  commitOffsets(evt.offset);
}
```

